<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>{{ ucfirst($kind) }} Tax Intake Questionnaire | US Tax Deals</title><meta name="description" content="Complete your {{ $kind }} tax intake with guided questions from US Tax Deals. Organize your information and receive a personalized document checklist."><link rel="canonical" href="{{ url('/tax-intake/'.$kind) }}"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0f1b2d"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/intake-assets/intake.css?v=20261015chat4"></head><body><header><a href="/" class="brand">US TAX DEALS <span>Tax Concierge</span></a><nav><a href="/tax-intake">Choose intake</a><a href="/contact">Get help</a></nav></header><main><section class="intro compact"><p class="eyebrow">{{ strtoupper($kind) }} TAX INTAKE</p><h1>Let’s get your year organized.</h1><p>One question at a time. Review every answer before you send it to your tax team.</p></section><div class="layout"><section class="conversation"><div class="top"><b>US Tax Deals assistant</b><span id="mode">Guided intake</span></div><progress id="progress" value="0" max="100" aria-label="Intake progress"></progress><p id="step-count" class="steps-label"></p><div id="transcript" aria-live="polite"></div><form id="answer-form"><label id="question" for="answer"></label><p id="help" class="muted"></p><div id="choices"></div><input id="answer" maxlength="1500" autocomplete="off"><div class="actions"><button id="back" type="button" class="secondary">Back</button><button id="why" type="button" class="secondary">Explain question</button><button id="next" type="submit">Continue →</button></div></form><section id="review" hidden><h2>Review your answers</h2><p>Check your details below. Use Back to edit to make changes.</p><dl id="review-list"></dl><button id="review-back" type="button" class="secondary">Back to edit</button> <button id="submit" type="button">Send to US Tax Deals</button></section><p id="status" role="status"></p><noscript><p>Please enable JavaScript to use guided intake, or <a href="/contact">contact our team</a> for help.</p></noscript></section><aside><section class="local-ai-card" aria-labelledby="ai-heading"><p class="eyebrow">US TAX DEALS · HERE TO HELP</p><h2 id="ai-heading">Tax intake chat</h2><p class="muted">Quick answers about your form and documents. Need a closer review? Send our team an inquiry.</p><p id="ai-status" class="mode-note" role="status">Chat ready</p><div id="ai-panel"><button id="ai-explain-current" class="secondary" type="button">Explain current question</button><label for="ai-message" class="muted">Ask about the intake or document checklist</label><textarea id="ai-message" maxlength="500" rows="3" placeholder="For example: Why do I need my W-2?"></textarea><button id="ai-send" type="button">Ask AI</button><button id="ai-summary" type="button" class="secondary">Build my intake summary</button><div id="ai-output" role="status" style="white-space:pre-wrap"></div><div id="ai-summary-box" hidden><label for="ai-draft">Optional summary for your preparer</label><textarea id="ai-draft" rows="5" maxlength="2500"></textarea><button id="ai-keep-draft" type="button">Include this summary</button><button id="ai-remove-draft" type="button" class="secondary">Remove summary</button></div><p class="muted">Answers use reviewed guidance, with AI matching in your browser. Do not enter tax IDs or bank numbers.</p></div></section><h2>A useful head start</h2><p>We’ll prepare:</p><ul><li>Your intake summary</li><li>A tailored document checklist</li><li>Follow-up items for your tax team</li></ul><p class="muted">This is intake screening, not a tax calculation or confirmation of eligibility. Your preparer checks federal and state requirements for your tax year.</p><p class="muted">Do not enter SSNs, EINs, bank numbers or document contents. Answers stay in this tab until you submit. Closing or reloading it clears your progress.</p><a href="/privacy-policy">How 